{"c":[{"id":"82906eb31b45a380","sum":"Stockroom: DuckDB warehouse, dual-manifest plugin, engine in skills/sr-search (scripts/ = ../../scripts). WSL walker survives stale /mnt. Session view keeps \\.cursor paths; pills only if corroborated. ERD from @rel tags; sr-query SKILL.md keeps the rest. No user uv indexes.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"d1eccd11dd08f3a5","sum":"Stockroom: DuckDB warehouse + dual-manifest Cursor/Claude plugin, engine in skills/sr-search/. WSL walker: a stale /mnt drive must not abort. Session view keeps \\.cursor paths (no CommonMark escapes); subagent pills never guess a turn; JSON keeps subagents/parent_spawn.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"d082cbb6d6679657","sum":"Stockroom: DuckDB warehouse + dual-manifest Cursor/Claude plugin; engine in skills/sr-search/. WSL walker: one stale /mnt drive must not abort. Cursor Path lines use backslashes; markdown-it collapses \\. (.cursor). Dashboard JSON export = full session_detail.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"a192d96d4c3ee4db","sum":"Stockroom: local DuckDB warehouse + dual-manifest Cursor/Claude Code plugin; skills sr-search/semantic/query/dashboard/initialize, engine in skills/sr-search/. Cursor model enrich WSL walker: one stale /mnt drive letter must not abort the walk.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T002308Z-d6e8a2c22f8985c0","text":"Stockroom: local DuckDB warehouse + dual-manifest Cursor/Claude Code plugin; skills sr-search/sr-semantic/sr-query/sr-dashboard/sr-initialize; engine in skills/sr-search/","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T005853Z-6a18e7ec63e59a25","text":"Cursor model enrich WSL walker lists /mnt names then stats each child; one stale drive letter must not abort the walk.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0a2c3d2fdf7f0057","sum":"Cursor skill Path lines use Windows backslashes; markdown-it collapses \\. so .cursor glues to the parent dir. Dashboard JSON export serializes full session_detail, so API payload additions change exported JSON unless filtered.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T134339Z-d618aad7ad08508d","text":"Cursor skill Path lines use Windows backslashes; warehouse keeps \\.cursor; dashboard markdown-it collapses \\. so .cursor glues to the parent dir.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T134816Z-efbe5193e7203f0e","text":"Dashboard JSON export serializes full session_detail; API payload additions automatically change exported JSON unless filtered.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ea5c9d2bd405c3e0","sum":"Session view: bindSessionMarkdown disables CommonMark escapes so \\.cursor paths render; subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) + parent: line never guess a turn: Claude joins spawn ids, Cursor only aligned zip or unique agent_type, rest omitted; JSON keeps subagents/parent_spawn.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"2464ad6d4d98dee3","sum":"Session markdown-it disables CommonMark escapes (bindSessionMarkdown) so \\.cursor paths render; dashboard subagent pills omit unmatched Claude spawn ids, JSON export keeps messages[].subagents and parent_spawn, and leftover is Cursor-only (needs parent message ordinals).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T135929Z-b16be49ee4a5a309","text":"Session-body markdown-it disables CommonMark escape via bindSessionMarkdown so \\.cursor and other hidden-dot paths survive render.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T140109Z-ffeba3eb9433dbab","text":"Dashboard subagent pills: Claude unmatched spawn ids omitted (no leftover); JSON export keeps messages[].subagents and parent_spawn; leftover is Cursor-only and needs parent message ordinals.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b5e01e46143d148c","sum":"Dashboard session view shows corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) and a parent: line, never guessing a turn: Claude joins spawn ids; Cursor places only an aligned zip (count + agent_type==subagent_type) or a unique agent_type; holes/extras omitted; unknown harness: none.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T154745Z-a99acf23a825f6a2","text":"Dashboard subagent pills: never guess a turn. Cursor leftover gone. Place only aligned zip (count + agent_type==subagent_type) or unique agent_type. Omit holes/extras. Unknown harness empty.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T161338Z-78459a311c0536ae","text":"Dashboard session view now shows corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) and a parent: line; Claude joins spawn ids, Cursor places only aligned or unique agent_type pairs, unknown harness omits.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8c758b43f9ea6ffb","sum":"Session view: subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) and parent: line only when corroborated. ERD: edges from -- @rel/@rel-none in migrations, views labeled name[\"name (view)\"]; sr-query SKILL.md keeps what ERD cannot show. No user-level uv indexes. sr-search sees scripts/ at ../../scripts","tree":{"c":[{"id":"29c75b2055bfd649","sum":"Session view: corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) + parent: line, never guessed. ERD edges: -- @rel / -- @rel-none in migrations/*.sql vs the head schema golden; no column docs from migration comments, @doc rejected. From skills/sr-search, root scripts/ is ../../scripts.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"ff5f55b02102dc3e","sum":"Session view: corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) + parent: line; Claude joins spawn ids, Cursor only aligned or unique agent_type pairs, unknown harness omits. ERD edges: -- @rel / -- @rel-none comments in migrations/*.sql, checked against the head schema golden.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T210631Z-10740a97904ab604","text":"Dashboard session view shows corroborated subagent pills (#msg-N-sa-M) and a parent: line; Claude joins spawn ids, Cursor places only aligned or unique agent_type pairs, unknown harness omits.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T161011Z-2822e87bc8170386","text":"Warehouse ERD edges: -- @rel / -- @rel-none comments in migrations/*.sql plus coverage against the head schema golden; not a Python relationship list and not a dummy DuckDB.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"e2a08ee3dba79144","sum":"Migration SQL comments are a write log, not a glossary: no column docs from them; @rel vs the head snapshot is the ERD edge source, @doc rejected. From skills/sr-search (uv --directory / Make UV_RUN cwd), repo-root scripts/ is ../../scripts, not ../scripts.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T162700Z-98da0bcb31c97c64","text":"Do not generate column-meaning docs from migration SQL comments: the chain is a write log, not a glossary. @rel vs head snapshot is the ERD edge source; @doc is rejected.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T164244Z-bd1d99298ee63baa","text":"From skills/sr-search (uv --directory / Make UV_RUN cwd), repo-root scripts/ is ../../scripts — not ../scripts (that is skills/scripts).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"fd833a13d357171f","sum":"ERD views get Mermaid alias labels name[\"name (view)\"] (%% comments do not render), pinned by a rendered-output contract; sr-query SKILL.md keeps what the ERD cannot show (thinking not captured, tool inputs only, project_id/cwd/workspace_key/entrypoint); no user-level uv indexes.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"262cf27713e88954","sum":"Warehouse ERD views are labeled with Mermaid entity aliases name[\"name (view)\"]: %% comments do not render in erDiagram boxes, so views (session_token_usage) need a visible label, pinned by a rendered-output contract.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T190402Z-6371376f562b82e0","text":"QA for warehouse-schema-docs failed: Mermaid %% view comment is invisible in rendered ERD, so session_token_usage is not visually distinguished from tables; Build must make views visibly labeled/styled and add a rendered-output contract.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T190854Z-e3140d8fbabc94db","text":"Warehouse ERD views use Mermaid entity aliases name[\"name (view)\"]; %% comments do not render in erDiagram boxes.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f0937a1056310039","sum":"sr-query SKILL.md keeps meanings the ERD cannot show (thinking not captured, tool inputs only, project_id/cwd/workspace_key/entrypoint); stockroom install never writes user-level uv extra indexes that bleed into other projects' locks.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T192526Z-070c0a987fc44833","text":"sr-query: replacing the column catalog with the ERD dropped meanings the picture cannot show; keep thinking-not-captured, tool-inputs-only, and project_id/cwd/workspace_key/entrypoint in SKILL.md.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260913T191146Z-bac17d4e200b9c2d","text":"Stockroom install must not write user-level uv extra indexes that bleed into other projects' locks.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ab16c7871ba7c86f","sum":"uv lock --no-config --refresh; CI uv 0.12.22. Scoped semantic ranks the joined set; VSS WHERE after HNSW. Docs omit --harness/--role. Claude tokens once per (message.id, requestId). subagentInfo stamps children; Tasks: CallDynamicTool cursor/Task. Only a dead shim is replaced.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"2d6dee9b8d77a730","sum":"Root uv lock: --no-config --refresh; CI uv 0.12.22 (lock rev 5; 0.8.22 rewrites to 3), bump only with a refresh. 1.5.4 VSS post-filters WHERE after HNSW: --harness/--role rank the joined set, no WHERE on the LIMIT query. Semantic ids before role (2.0.0).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"c55e5c34ee713bca","sum":"Root uv lock needs --no-config --refresh (--locked alone accepts a pytorch-index lock). CI pins uv 0.12.22; lock --refresh writes revision 5, and uv 0.8.22 rewrites it to 3. Bump that pin only with a refresh from 0.12.22. Semantic tsv and table include session_id and message_id.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"9d643efe7d7e9cc8","sum":"uv lock --locked without --refresh accepts a pytorch-index lock as current, so the root docs lock uses --no-config --refresh. Semantic tsv and table include session_id and message_id; do not document JSON as the only handoff to query.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260913T191535Z-13e9bab5c49f07d0","text":"uv lock --locked without --refresh treats a pytorch-index lock as current; root docs lock must use --no-config --refresh.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T193807Z-4efc5d97f1279b70","text":"stockroom semantic tsv and table include session_id and message_id; do not document JSON as the only shape that can hand off to query.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"20fe4911ab451244","sum":"Root uv.lock revision is 5 for uv 0.12 lock --refresh --locked; uv 0.8.22 rewrites that revision to 3. CI uv is pinned to 0.12.22 in ci.yaml and docs.yaml. Bump that pin only together with a lock refresh from that same uv.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T194958Z-1341312456d701ec","text":"Root uv.lock revision is 5 for uv 0.12 lock --refresh --locked. uv 0.8.22 rewrites that revision back to 3.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T195915Z-9e5f10b38f9fb742","text":"CI uv is pinned to 0.12.22 in ci.yaml and docs.yaml. Bump that pin only together with a lock refresh from that same uv.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"c53d131b7fa46813","sum":"DuckDB 1.5.4 VSS post-filters WHERE after HNSW, so semantic --harness/--role rank the joined set; never add WHERE to the HNSW LIMIT query. chore(semantic)! (ids before role) cut 2.0.0. BgeEncoder drops only the Hub unauthenticated notice; other _http warnings log.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"d133a7aa26b2284c","sum":"DuckDB 1.5.4 VSS post-filters WHERE after HNSW: a harness predicate plus ORDER BY distance LIMIT can return zero rows. Semantic tsv/table put session_id and message_id before role, a breaking shift marked chore(semantic)! so release-please cut 2.0.0.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T180756Z-1e00dec009646749","text":"DuckDB 1.5.4 VSS post-filters WHERE after HNSW: embeddings harness predicate plus ORDER BY distance LIMIT can return zero rows while matches exist.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T181638Z-94dbcd6e44d4af97","text":"Default semantic tsv and table insert session_id and message_id before role. That shift is breaking: marker commit chore(semantic)! so release-please cuts 2.0.0, not 1.3.0.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8b5dfc860fd2304a","sum":"semantic --harness/--role rank embeddings joined to messages; never add WHERE to the HNSW LIMIT query (DuckDB VSS post-filters it). BgeEncoder drops only the Hub unauthenticated-request notice; other huggingface_hub _http warnings, incl. failed downloads, still log.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T195045Z-3d49f28ec61f9e73","text":"stockroom semantic --harness and --role rank embeddings joined to messages. Do not add WHERE to the HNSW LIMIT query; DuckDB VSS post-filters that shape.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T204959Z-929c764401ba7c67","text":"BgeEncoder drops the Hub unauthenticated-request notice. Other huggingface_hub.utils._http warnings, including a failed download, still log.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"c58802e6a3337267","sum":"Docs omit semantic --harness/--role. Claude tokens once per (message.id, requestId); subagent copies carry none; vanished rows stay. subagentInfo stamps children; Task slots include CallDynamicTool cursor/Task. .git and Makefile are not dev markers; only a dead shim is replaced.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"378a965d09cd0cf8","sum":"Human pages omit semantic --harness/--role (home: sr-semantic SKILL.md). Claude tokens: once per (message.id, requestId), field max; subagent copies carry none; vanished rows stay. Cursor CLI subagents: subagentInfo parentAgentId/toolCallId/typeName; spawn CallDynamicTool Task.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"e0aca5420853595c","sum":"Human pages omit semantic --harness/--role (flag home: sr-semantic SKILL.md). Claude message tokens stored once per (message.id, requestId), field-wise max; subagent copies of a parent response carry none; vanished transcripts are not rewritten.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T220128Z-48f450097d0ca431","text":"Human pages do not list semantic --harness or --role. Flag home is skills/sr-semantic/SKILL.md; the sr-search route row and the two-path sentence stay.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T164010Z-c6c38050580988bb","text":"Claude message tokens are stored once per (message.id, requestId), field-wise max; a subagent copy of a parent response carries none. Transcripts that are gone are not rewritten.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"7fd1420334a977b2","sum":"Vanished Claude token rows stay stored (message.id/requestId never persisted; gaps between equal cache triples occur in one response). Cursor CLI subagent children: meta.subagentInfo parentAgentId, toolCallId, typeName; spawn is CallDynamicTool namespace=cursor toolName=Task.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T193126Z-43be936f55bee97c","text":"Vanished Claude token rows stay stored: message.id and requestId were never persisted, and a user row or time gap between equal cache triples also occurs inside one response.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T014749Z-e1cebfcb88bd6cfa","text":"Cursor CLI subagents: child meta.subagentInfo has parentAgentId, toolCallId, typeName. Parent spawn is CallDynamicTool args namespace=cursor toolName=Task, not a tool named Task. CLI ingest ignores subagentInfo, so no dashboard inset.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"740564f94144b5c0","sum":"Stamps subagent children from meta.subagentInfo. Task slots: CallDynamicTool cursor/Task. .git and Makefile are not dev markers; rectify replaces a dead shim only. Owner: default plugin dirs by path; a checkout is dev; elsewhere CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT means cursor, else Claude asks.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"15791adfd675f0b1","sum":"CLI ingest stamps subagent children from meta.subagentInfo; dashboard Task slots include CallDynamicTool cursor/Task. Plugin cache copies hold .git and Makefile, not dev markers. rectify replaces a dead shim of any owner; live foreign or unknown files stay.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261016T022227Z-ccb5b17bf805c62a","text":"CLI ingest stamps subagent children from meta.subagentInfo (parentAgentId, toolCallId, typeName). Dashboard Task slots include CallDynamicTool cursor/Task; children with a spawn id join before the zip.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T195949Z-b101405aa74423ff","text":"Marketplace plugin copies (Claude and Cursor caches) contain .git and Makefile: neither marks a dev checkout. shim rectify replaces a dead shim of any owner; live foreign shims and unidentified files stay untouched.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"05faf29885d0e87f","sum":"sr-initialize owner: default plugin dirs by path (cache/synced = claude/cursor); a checkout load is dev. Elsewhere CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT means cursor, else Claude asks. A substituted CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT is not proof. Agent shells never get that env; skill text gets the exact token.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261016T195949Z-c42d3773b4d4c55f","text":"sr-initialize owner: engine under .../cache/<mkt>/<plugin>/<ver> (or Claude synced/) is claude/cursor; any checkout load (--plugin-dir, Cursor plugins/local, mirror) is dev. Agent shells never get plugin-root env; Claude substitutes exact ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT} in skill text.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T215531Z-8195092923e19a0d","text":"sr-initialize owner: path decides in default plugins dirs (.claude/plugins/cache|synced, .cursor/plugins/cache); elsewhere CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT holding the engine is cursor, else Claude Code asks. Substituted CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT is not proof: --plugin-dir substitutes checkouts.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
